            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (Hardness 8, HP 72, BT 36). The shield is a religious symbol of Torag."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "You and any adjacent allies have fire resistance 5 while you have the shield raised. When used for a Shield Block, the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "forge warden",
            "marks": ["emphasis"]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " rings out like the hammer strike of a blacksmith, and the symbol glows as if lit by the fires of a furnace."
          }
        ]
      },
